## Change

- The Lite control header now has four inherited `RpcRequestHeader` fields, so
  Core could no longer pass the unit-struct type as a value.
- Updated six calls in `MQClientApi` for check-client, query-assignment,
  set-message-request-mode, Lite subscription control, and batch-ack to use
  `LiteSubscriptionCtlRequestHeader::default()`.
- The empty default encodes no ext fields, preserving the requests' wire
  header behavior.

